Why This Market Matters
LABSA is a foundational intermediate for the production of linear alkylbenzene sulfonate, a widely used anionic surfactant in cleaning formulations. The market combines large-volume commodity demand with increasingly specification-driven requirements around active matter, color, free acid, viscosity, chain distribution, and biodegradability. Suppliers that combine reliable LAB sourcing, efficient sulfonation, consistent quality, and technical support can strengthen their position across large detergent accounts and specialty applications.

